item_name = "Brine Tonic"
description = "Saltwater boiled until it thickens, sealed in a clay bottle. Drink it and salt crystallises under your skin — blows bounce, blades skip. You can barely move, but for eight seconds nothing in the world can hurt you much. Incoming damage reduced 40%, speed reduced 20%. Consumable."
